<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales fell 1.3 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales fell 1.3 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales fell 1.3 percent in August, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   AUG 96     YEAR TO DATE</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    -1.3	  -0.3</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores  0.0	  +1.4</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     -2.8	  -2.4</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
